'''Sculdun Tower'''<ref name="Score">{{OST|Andor: Season 2 - Vol. 2 (Episodes 4-6) (Original Score)}}</ref> was a lavish office tower on [[Coruscant]] used by [[Chandrilan]] aristocrat [[Davo Sculdun]] during the [[Imperial Era]].<ref name="Gallery Databank" /> Located on the top of a tall building, the office had an elongated domed roof and a two leveled plaza with a landing pad that extended from one end of the building.<ref name="What a Festive Evening" /> Within the building Sculdun kept an exclusive [[Davo Sculdun's gallery|art gallery]] of rare artifacts which only select guests were allowed to tour.<ref name="Gallery Databank" /> 

In [[3 BBY]],<ref name="206Date">{{AndorDate|206}}</ref> Sculdun hosted a [[Senate Investiture]] [[Davo Sculdun's party|party]] at the office during [[Ascension Week]].<ref name="What a Festive Evening" />

==Behind the scenes==
The office appeared in the [[What a Festive Evening|sixth episode]] of the [[Andor Season 2|second season]] of the television series ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'',<ref name="What a Festive Evening" /> which aired on [[April 29]], [[2025]].<ref name="Trailer News">{{SW|url=news/andor-season-2-teaser-trailer-key-art-reveal|text=First ''Andor A Star Wars Story'' Teaser Trailer and Poster Revealed}}</ref>

